{"id":"comparacio_n","lemma":"comparación","pos":"noun","rank":4135,"glosses":["comparison"],"ipa":"/kompaɾaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"comparaciones"},"order":4136,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-comparaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"La comparación es apropiada.","en":"The comparison is apt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301880","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"appropriate, suitable","l":"apropiado"}]},{"text":"Su nueva novela es realmente interesante en comparación con la última.","en":"Her new novel is really interesting as opposed to her last one.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"news, novelty"},{"g":"novel"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"really"},{"g":"interesting"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"final","l":"último"}]},{"text":"Nuestros problemas no son nada en comparación con los de Tom.","en":"Our problems are nothing compared to Tom's.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}